       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. B016.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-NUM PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
       COMPUTE WS-NUM = (3 * 4) + 2.
       IF WS-NUM = 14
          DISPLAY "FOURTEEN"
       ELSE
          DISPLAY "OTHER"
       END-IF.
       STOP RUN.
